<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman ups I.M.A.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman ups I.M.A.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's I.M.A. SpA, a recently-quoted company which makes machines for the packaging industry, was raised to the &quot;recommended list&quot; from &quot;market underperformer&quot; at Goldman Sachs.</p>
<p>Goldman also set a 12-18 month price target of 8,000 lire for the stock. Further details were not immediately avaialble.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
